source "Kconfig.zephyr"

menu "Texas Instruments Bluetooth Mesh UART Bridge Sample"

config BT_MESH_UART_BRIDGE_PAYLOAD_LEN
    int "Maximum payload length for UART Bridge model to be sent through mesh"
    default 100
    range 1 377
    help
      Maximum payload length for UART Bridge model to be sent through mesh. The
      maximum access layer payload length is 384. However, that includes the
      opcode (3 bytes) and the transMIC (4 bytes). These bytes are subtracted
      from the maximum access layer payload length to get the maximum UART Bridge
      payload length of 377 bytes.

endmenu
